# Base URL of the API (Tomcat Application context must be /CoHabitAPI)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/CoHabitAPI/api/tasks

# Uses the test data of task-test-data.sql (no id needed here, only the emails)
# tasktestroomshare       : owner, accepted1, accepted2, pending
# tasktestroomshare_other : owner_other, roomie_other
# A GET has no body: the email is sent in the URL (?roomieEmail=...)

### 1. Accepted roomie → 200, the tasks of tasktestroomshare + "roomies" = accepted1 and accepted2 only (not pending)
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=task_roomie_accepted1@test.be
Accept: application/json

### 2. The other accepted roomie of the same roomshare → 200, exactly the same answer as request 1
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=task_roomie_accepted2@test.be
Accept: application/json

### 3. Accepted roomie of the other roomshare → 200, none of the tasks of tasktestroomshare, "roomies" = RoomieOther only
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=task_roomie_other@test.be
Accept: application/json

### 4. Email with spaces and uppercase → 200, same answer as request 1 (cleaned like the login)
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=%20%20TASK_ROOMIE_ACCEPTED1@test.be%20
Accept: application/json

### 5. Unknown extra parameter → 200, ignored (same answer as request 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=task_roomie_accepted1@test.be&roomshareId=999
Accept: application/json

### 6. An owner → 403, "This type of user cannot do this action."
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=task_owner@test.be
Accept: application/json

### 7. A pending roomie → 403, "You must be an accepted member of a roomshare."
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=task_roomie_pending@test.be
Accept: application/json

### 8. A roomie without roomshare → 403, "You must be an accepted member of a roomshare."
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=task_roomie_none@test.be
Accept: application/json

### 9. Unknown email → 401, "Authentication required."
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=nobody@mail.be
Accept: application/json

### 10. Missing email → 400, "Email is required"
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Empty email → 400, "Email is required"
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=
Accept: application/json

### 12. Email with only spaces → 400, "Email is required"
GET {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=%20%20%20
Accept: application/json

### 13. Wrong HTTP method → 405 (there is no PUT on /api/tasks)
PUT {{baseUrl}}?roomieEmail=task_roomie_accepted1@test.be
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### CORS preflight for a GET (what the browser sends)
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}
Origin: http://127.0.0.1:5501
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
